<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Fortnite</Major>
    <Description>idk how to explain to how to do it but evantually you might know,  so yeah

Fortnite Marco, easy and simple! (F keybind only for editing)

Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>fortnite marco editor</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 9 1
Delay 2 ms
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 2 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 2 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 2 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>